us of a circle.</li><li data-ref="2219f13d-756a-4720-ac6d-3a14ed5353a1">The second line contains three space-separated floats representing the sides of a triangle.</li><li data-ref="8f47ca8f-b862-42e4-b88c-188142da63dc">The third line contains a single float representing the side length of a square.</li></ul><p data-ref="f9349e5c-ba8c-462d-b274-14dac5886624" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="c8464bba-a0d5-4356-b483-caffe47a9cc1"></p><p data-ref="6c5f04f9-f483-4e61-a593-dc7bb93b0146" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="bd26468b-c2a8-4a40-9a0a-38d4f4726cce">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="80b00bdf-ae62-470e-b463-dc3b9a7f24f4" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="fd3b32bd-9f22-4f28-8c45-605360596763">Print the area and perimeter of the circle on one line, separated by a space, formatted to two decimal places.</li><li data-ref="8806c787-7907-4a02-bd32-59dd55bde367">Print the area and perimeter of the triangle on the next line, separated by a space, formatted to two decimal places